                                "sense_id": "a19f6269-f2d1-3eef-9863-d404793491da",
                                "text": "\"I tried to cheer her up a little with touches of warm tones here and there--all lies--same kind you tell your own chickabiddy when she's blue--but she wouldn't have it and cried straight ahead for four hours until the sun came out; but I was through by that time and waded ashore."
